# API de Autenticação: requisições de exemplo
# Requer a extensão REST Client do VS Code e o servidor rodando.
# Execute na ordem: o login (nº 8) guarda o token usado na rota protegida (nº 12).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Status da API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Cadastro válido (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### 3. Cadastro com e-mail repetido (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### 4. Cadastro sem nome (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### 5. Cadastro com e-mail inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João",
  "email": "joao-sem-arroba",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### 6. Cadastro com senha curta (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 7. Cadastro com senha numérica (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "password": 12345678
}

### 8. Login válido (200)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### 9. Login com senha errada (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "senhaerrada"
}

### 10. Login com e-mail inexistente (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ninguem@email.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### 11. Login sem senha (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@email.com"
}

### 12. Rota protegida com token válido (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 13. Rota protegida sem token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

### 14. Rota protegida com token inválido (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer token-falso

### 15. Rota inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/nada

### 16. JSON malformado (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria",}